    <p>If your online search on Kaveri 2.0 returns <em>"No Records Found"</em> or exhibits data discrepancies, follow these troubleshooting steps:</p>
    <ul style="line-height: 1.8;">
        <li><strong>Pre-2004 Historical Records:</strong> Properties registered prior to April 1, 2004 are maintained in handwritten physical Index II ledgers at the SRO office. Citizens must submit Form 22 offline at the Sub-Registrar office counter to receive a physical sealed Form 15.</li>
        <li><strong>Spelling or Hobli Name Variations:</strong> SRO databases may store older hobli or village spelling variants. Perform a survey number search without entering party names, or consult the local SRO revenue map index.</li>
        <li><strong>Rectification of Omitted Entries:</strong> If a registered deed is missing from an issued EC, present the certified sale deed copy and receipt to the Sub-Registrar. The SRO officer will verify physical Index II logs and issue a corrected supplementary certificate.</li>
    </ul>

